  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="work" n="216">
        <pb n="264"/>
        <head>Another on the holy martyrs.</head>
        <head>216 — vi.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">The festival of the holy martyrs is the joy and pleasure of all the churches; a strong<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/> wall for all the inhabited<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> earth; and the victory of kings; and the glory of priests. Pray and entreat and supplicate the <persName>Saviour</persName> of all for us, Halleluyah!</ab>
        </div>
        <pb n="265"/>
        <div type="trailer">
          <ab n="2">But, if it is the festival of the God-bearer, he changes it and says thus : <quote>The festival of the God-bearer</quote>, and all the rest as given above<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/>.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 264, n. 4</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>that cannot be broken through</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 264, n. 5</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>inhabitable</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 265, n. 1</orig></choice> In the index the hymn to the Virgin is numbered separately, and the numeration therefore from this point differs from that in the text. See p. 30 note.</note>
      </noteGrp>
    </body>
